      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The first frame house appeared in 1884, and a cemetery was dedicated on land donated by Thomas Cahill, marking the town’s early growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
